        "original_id": "11588c81-c957-58ea-97a4-078594feaabc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John C. Talbot\n- Organizations: Maine Legislature\n- Places: Augusta, State House\n- Roles: Democrat, Maine House of Representatives, Maine Senate\n\nFacts:\n- In 1825, John C. Talbot served a one-year term in the Maine House of Representatives.\n- In 1831, John C. Talbot served another one-year term in the Maine House of Representatives.\n- Since 1832, the Maine Legislature has convened at the State House in Augusta.\n- In 1832 and 1833, John C. Talbot served in the Maine Senate.\n- In 1836 and 1837, John C. Talbot served in the Maine Senate.\n- John C. Talbot was a Democrat and served six one-year terms in the Maine Legislature.",
